sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    
    box "Mobile Device Context" #f9f9f9
        participant NativeApp as Native Mobile App<br/>(Dashboard & Shell)
        participant WebComp as Robo Web Component<br/>(Hosted in Rancher SCP)
        participant MarstoneWebView as Marstone WebView<br/>(New Container)
    end
    
    participant MobileBackend as Mobile App Backend
    participant PseudoIdP as Bank Pseudo-IdP<br/>(Internal Only)
    participant OKKK as OKKK (CIAM)
    participant Auth0 as Marstone Auth0

    note over User, NativeApp: User is logged in and viewing Mobile Dashboard

    User->>NativeApp: 1. Clicks "Robo-Advisory" Banner
    
    note right of NativeApp: App navigates to Robo feature.
    NativeApp->>WebComp: 2. Load "Robo Web Component"
    
    User->>WebComp: 3. Verify Customer Info (Review Screen)
    User->>WebComp: 4. Clicks "Launch Marstone" Button
    
    note left of WebComp: Component signals intent via JS Bridge.
    WebComp-->>NativeApp: 5. Send Message: {action: "launch_marstone"}
    
    note right of NativeApp: Native Shell receives signal.<br/>Initiates secure backend flow.
    NativeApp->>MobileBackend: 6. Request Launch (w/ OKKK Access Token)
    
    note right of MobileBackend: Security Boundary:<br/>Validates Mobile App request.
    MobileBackend->>PseudoIdP: 7. Forward Request (Whitelisted Internal IP)
    
    PseudoIdP->>OKKK: 8. API Call: /introspect (Validate Token)
    OKKK-->>PseudoIdP: 9. Token Valid (User Verified)
    
    note right of PseudoIdP: 10. Generate & Sign SAML Response.
    PseudoIdP-->>MobileBackend: Return HTML "Auto-Submit" Form
    MobileBackend-->>NativeApp: Return HTML Form
    
    note right of NativeApp: 11. Initialize NEW WebView.<br/>Robo Component remains active.
    NativeApp->>MarstoneWebView: 12. Load HTML Form into Marstone WebView
    
    MarstoneWebView->>Auth0: 13. POST /login/callback (SAMLResponse)
    note left of Auth0: 14. Auth0 Validates Signature & Creates Session.
    Auth0-->>MarstoneWebView: 15. Redirect to Marstone URL
    
    MarstoneWebView->>MarstoneWebView: 16. Load Marstone App (Auto-Login via OIDC)
    MarstoneWebView-->>User: 17. User sees Marstone Dashboard
